    "media:imagetext": "The Appeal of\na Profitmaker\nAn ideal blend of form and function,\nthe 767 interior will appeal to pas-\nsengers and operators alike.\nPassengers will appreciate the\nunique twin-aisle, seven-abreast\nseating arrangement. No one will sit\nmore than one seat from the aisle. And\nno one need be assigned a middle\nseat until the 767 is 86% filled.\nTo keep carry-on bags from under-\nfoot, the 767 offers more overhead\nstowage than any current airplane-\nmore than 2.7 cubic feet per passenger.\nOperators will appreciate the\nefficiency of the twin aisles, the\nconstant-width interior, the mid-cabin\nlavatories, and the efficiently\ndesigned forward and rear galleys.\nAnd they will like the precise\nclimate control system, knowing that\npassenger comfort is assured.\nThe Boeing 767: ideal comfort and\nefficiency for the medium-size,\nmedium-range market. That's the\nappeal of a profitmaker.\nBOEING\nPIARA ARAARAAARAA AAAAAAAAAAAAAAARAIS 9\n18 FIRST CLASS - 38 IN. PITCH\n211 PASSENGERS\nPLACA AAAAAAAAAA 00000 A A A A A A A HARASS",
